Solution: take the screenshot through Playwright (page.screenshot) which composites correctly, then analyze the PNG. I can decode the PNG in Node... but no PNG library? I can use `sharp`? Not installed. 

Alternative: use `renderer.domElement.toDataURL()` inside a rAF callback right after render — but that also requires preserveDrawingBuffer.

